<%# The header both views of the public register share: the section title
    "Zmluvy" (the page's one h1) and the list / statistics switch on one
    row. One partial, one structure, so the switch keeps its exact position
    when the reader changes view and only the active state moves. A view that
    needs its own heading (the statistics) sets it as an h2 below this row.
    locals: current (:catalogue | :statistics) %>
<header class="cs-top">
  <h1 class="cs-top__title"><%= t("decidim.contracts_sk.contracts.index.title") %></h1>
  <%= render "decidim/contracts_sk/shared/section_switch", current: current %>
</header>
